{"date":"2026-10-04","on_shelf":[],"presented_event_with_attribution":"Ramesh says: “Ji sir. Aloo paratha garam hai, curd aur achaar bhi table par hai. Aap aaram se khaayein.” Ramesh straightens the pickle jar and steps back.","prior_record_files":{"2026-10-02":"cf7a480104e051a2d1be3dbcabed4381a58ef96ec30bdc6002134b76cbd995c8","2026-10-03":"988ad816613474bcea5dddd7b897674b951aaa4bd9a7b163222f1d6b4d8eff67"},"reference":"59d264248e97bb50d734672f41c1724e0d7353738a1a43a8f77d2846ed5c931c","time":"07:30","typed_records":[{"amount":1500,"canonical_id":null,"creditor":"Ramesh","direction":"out","id":"2026-10-04:payment:b290d82c8b989205:1","item":"Groceries for Ramesh's kitchen","kind":"payment","medium":"cash","payer":null,"place":"home","settled":true,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":0,"sha256":"b290d82c8b989205adf8f38d7d846c4e2ec00e159c0cdba8c4d399a179ce0465"},"time":"06:04"},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:9f1f16843f0ec67a:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":3,"sha256":"9f1f16843f0ec67abeaf35e99492cdc47b32ab2fc074c7993a0133031317f091"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:04","verified":false,"words":"Ramesh, before breakfast: does the estate office work on Sundays, and when does the dhobi come this week? I must settle the file on Monday and the bill on Saturday."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:f94c0685789d030d:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":4,"sha256":"f94c0685789d030d0d373abc1edf1515d29141bd90bb1e1ede20749b8de14715"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"06:04","verified":false,"words":"Office band hai aaj, sir, Monday ko aap aayenge toh kholenge. Dhobi kal subah aayega, ek din pehle aa raha hai is hafte."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:b3556a7d4541a9d3:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":6,"sha256":"b3556a7d4541a9d31fae1ea8c208ae7a1e19c126e21c06a75110633cdb1ff80d"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:14","verified":false,"words":"Very good, Ramesh. Then breakfast at seven, and after it I shall walk in the garden while the air is clear. Keep the dhobi’s bill ready for tomorrow, and let me see it before he leaves."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:d2f2ed5b90c3d588:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":7,"sha256":"d2f2ed5b90c3d588d4e9bd511301622cc6f16c1ed00b7938cf8089386ebed5c2"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"06:14","verified":false,"words":"Haan sir, chhaay ke baad main garden ki side khol dunga. Dhobi ka bill main abhi apke study table par rakhta hoon, aap subah check kar lein."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:14a2b0267a81fe6a:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":9,"sha256":"14a2b0267a81fe6a15928d1cfc0e2a2a22468e22c70d3c10377db843ed0be6b8"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:00","verified":false,"words":"Bahut accha, Ramesh. I shall look at the bill after breakfast; the garden side may wait until the shade is gone."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:d360cb9b57b6d09c:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":10,"sha256":"d360cb9b57b6d09ce1c12e05c648688becca56f67422f4c20d72ecb0b500a424"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:00","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir. Aloo paratha garam hai, curd aur achaar bhi table par hai. Aap aaram se khaayein."},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:ed74cbb2c83dc605:1","intended_time":"07:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":0,"sha256":"ed74cbb2c83dc605435db69ca331fc213ccab9a4667638dc315dca436c2aa5f1"},"status":"planned","text":"Have breakfast, and ask Ramesh what the estate office does on Sundays and when the dhobi comes.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:10ff9f38c2a45ff5:1","intended_time":"08:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":1,"sha256":"10ff9f38c2a45ff54898a6fa27d5dc6d89c47678dbf7ee1cdb2cbf50c5bc85a9"},"status":"planned","text":"Walk in Lodhi Gardens while the air is clear, and let the file's contradiction settle.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:7abcaedbd0763990:1","intended_time":"10:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":2,"sha256":"7abcaedbd07639906cfcbafdbfdbbf459afe848af057ead3db4d9410d4b45d27"},"status":"planned","text":"Read the file at home on the misdescription, noting where sign and Notion part.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:71f6325882baf32b:1","intended_time":"13:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":3,"sha256":"71f6325882baf32bf5da335859dd3ea38828f0b74cb06cd1e26bce3fb0542e86"},"status":"planned","text":"Rest at home, then write a short note for Monday's meeting with Shri Hegde.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:a9823f90ed28108e:1","intended_time":"16:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":4,"sha256":"a9823f90ed28108ed34eafaacfb0ca394f48470de786ac04d344ec798ad78a0d"},"status":"planned","text":"Review my vouchers and the dhobi's Saturday bill before the evening.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"action":"talk","end":"06:14","id":"2026-10-04:event:af7cad893ab49293:1","kind":"event","place":"home","source":{"collection":"steps","index":0,"sha256":"af7cad893ab49293c958b6d9f50cb887063bc064f84b4bb96e530569cd207dc3"},"time":"06:04","type":"action"},{"action":"talk","end":"07:00","id":"2026-10-04:event:e8eaf5c26cb1fd98:1","kind":"event","place":"home","source":{"collection":"steps","index":1,"sha256":"e8eaf5c26cb1fd9828a308c68701ba744eb264a14bb7953080b790590de95a3f"},"time":"06:14","type":"action"},{"action":"eat","end":"07:30","id":"2026-10-04:event:0530638b7f0a77db:1","kind":"event","place":"home","source":{"collection":"steps","index":2,"sha256":"0530638b7f0a77dbff92c24a369a6c520658be9788140122eb2097272ed54fd1"},"time":"07:00","type":"action"},{"id":"20